6:
7:## two neuroanatomical obsessive-compulsive disorder subtypes
8:
9:Baohong Wen 1,7 , Keke Fang 2,3,4,7 , Qiuying Tao 1 , Ya Tian 1 , Lianjie Niu 5 , Wenqing Shi 1 , Zijun Liu 1 , Jin Sun 1 , Liang Liu 1 , Xiaopan Zhang 1 , Ruiping Zheng 1 , Hui-Rong Guo 6 , Yarui Wei 1 , Yong Zhang 1 ✉ , Jingliang Cheng 1 ✉ and Shaoqiang Han 1 ✉
